4
00:00:06,018 --> 00:00:07,621
So how does that work?

5
00:00:07,883 --> 00:00:09,243
First, the database.

6
00:00:09,519 --> 00:00:10,662
Every short code

7
00:00:10,544 --> 00:00:11,478
is one row:

8
00:00:11,737 --> 00:00:13,503
