13
00:00:18,898 --> 00:00:20,038
the server looks

14
00:00:19,923 --> 00:00:20,858
up the row,

15
00:00:20,896 --> 00:00:22,537
and answers with a 301.

16
00:00:22,796 --> 00:00:23,742
Then, scale.

17
00:00:24,007 --> 00:00:25,055
Now imagine a

18
