10,000 requests hit

20
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:28,786
the same row,

21
00:00:28,824 --> 00:00:30,010
so a cache in

22
00:00:29,884 --> 00:00:31,476
front of Postgres answers

23
00:00:31,369 --> 00:00:32,371
most of them.

24
00:00:32,633 --> 00:00:34,249
Follow for more breakdowns,

